1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 3=

3
00:00:14,888 --> 00:00:16,009
Are you out of your mind?

4
00:00:20,129 --> 00:00:21,888
Ever since Jiasheng got into trouble,

5
00:00:22,529 --> 00:00:24,168
I've been holding onto this grenade.

6
00:00:25,088 --> 00:00:26,928
I had a feeling it'd come in handy.

7
00:00:28,608 --> 00:00:29,768
Don't you value your life?

8
00:00:30,329 --> 00:00:31,329
If I played it safe,

9
00:00:32,049 --> 00:00:33,689
could I hold them off?

10
00:00:44,969 --> 00:00:48,329
They say Lu from Prosperity
is a lunatic.

11
00:00:48,448 --> 00:00:49,649
You truly live up to your name.

12
00:00:50,609 --> 00:00:51,609
Still,

13
00:00:51,969 --> 00:00:53,369
you wouldn't dare blow it up.

14
00:00:57,329 --> 00:00:58,329
Seriously?

15
00:01:02,049 --> 00:01:03,728
I thought you weren't afraid to die.

16
00:01:05,528 --> 00:01:06,848
I'm not afraid to die,

17
00:01:07,969 --> 00:01:09,689
but my brothers are here.

18
00:01:09,929 --> 00:01:11,528
I can't let them die here.

19
00:01:13,648 --> 00:01:14,809
As for what happened to my brother,

20
00:01:16,408 --> 00:01:17,648
this isn't over.

21
00:01:17,928 --> 00:01:18,928
Prosperity,

22
00:01:19,208 --> 00:01:20,329
I'll come back.

23
00:01:24,329 --> 00:01:25,729
Why are you laughing?

24
00:01:26,848 --> 00:01:28,208
Because I remembered

25
00:01:28,208 --> 00:01:30,208
Jiasheng was going to kill Bai Ruxue,

26
00:01:30,408 --> 00:01:31,809
and you risked your life to save her.

27
00:01:32,889 --> 00:01:34,488
She's latched onto Feng now,

28
00:01:34,488 --> 00:01:35,809
and this is how she repays you.

29
00:01:36,928 --> 00:01:37,928
Do you regret it?

30
00:01:39,848 --> 00:01:41,008
Jiasheng had foresight.

31
00:01:41,249 --> 00:01:42,529
I should've listened to him.

32
00:01:43,848 --> 00:01:44,969
Feng told me

33
00:01:45,288 --> 00:01:47,049
he arranged an old friend in prison

34
00:01:47,128 --> 00:01:48,368
to welcome Jiasheng.

35
00:01:49,169 --> 00:01:51,208
Neither of them
tells me anything anymore.

36
00:01:52,169 --> 00:01:53,729
How did things turn out like this?

37
00:01:55,128 --> 00:01:56,128
Mr. Tu,

38
00:01:56,368 --> 00:01:57,368
I've heard so much about you.

39
00:01:57,848 --> 00:01:58,969
A real pleasure.

40
00:02:04,049 --> 00:02:06,008
Mr. Tu, I'm so sorry.

41
00:02:06,329 --> 00:02:07,488
I'll get that for you.

42
00:02:09,288 --> 00:02:10,288
Sorry about that.

43
00:02:10,329 --> 00:02:11,408
I stepped on

44
00:02:11,848 --> 00:02:13,288
Mr. Tu's foot again.

45
00:02:14,449 --> 00:02:16,928
Does it hurt, Mr. Tu?

46
00:02:17,289 --> 00:02:20,088
Tell me if it does.

47
00:02:20,248 --> 00:02:22,009
Don't hold it in.

48
00:02:28,449 --> 00:02:29,449
Boss, check this out.

49
00:02:29,609 --> 00:02:30,609
Give that back.

50
00:02:32,528 --> 00:02:35,009
- Give it back!
- Who's this chick?

51
00:02:35,648 --> 00:02:37,009
She's smoking hot.

52
00:02:37,009 --> 00:02:38,009
Give it back to me!

53
00:02:38,009 --> 00:02:39,009
How about

54
00:02:39,329 --> 00:02:41,088
let me use it for a bit?

55
00:02:41,688 --> 00:02:42,688
So at night,

56
00:02:42,968 --> 00:02:45,049
I can hang it by my bed.

57
00:02:48,569 --> 00:02:49,569
Sangkun,

58
00:02:50,329 --> 00:02:52,688
this is Mr. Tu's most precious woman.

59
00:02:52,688 --> 00:02:53,688
Too bad

60
00:02:53,729 --> 00:02:54,729
she's dead.

61
00:02:55,248 --> 00:02:56,409
What a real shame.

62
00:02:56,569 --> 00:02:57,928
A picture of a dead person...

63
00:02:58,688 --> 00:03:00,289
That's bad luck.

64
00:03:01,129 --> 00:03:02,488
After all these years,

65
00:03:03,569 --> 00:03:04,808
you are still keeping it.

66
00:03:05,889 --> 00:03:07,368
Why not

67
00:03:09,169 --> 00:03:10,208
just burn it?

68
00:03:13,368 --> 00:03:14,528
Strip his pants off.

69
00:03:14,528 --> 00:03:16,409
Let me have some fun right in front

70
00:03:16,409 --> 00:03:17,528
of his lover.

71
00:03:17,569 --> 00:03:18,768
I said, give it back!

72
00:03:36,129 --> 00:03:38,088
- Beat him to death!
- Kill him!

73
00:04:02,808 --> 00:04:04,808
Brawling with weapons?

74
00:04:05,449 --> 00:04:06,729
How dare you!

75
00:04:07,088 --> 00:04:08,088
Captain Xia,

76
00:04:08,409 --> 00:04:10,488
Mr. Tu and I are old friends.

77
00:04:10,609 --> 00:04:11,768
They were just fooling around.

78
00:04:11,768 --> 00:04:13,528
Yes, Captain Xia, just fooling around.

79
00:04:13,569 --> 00:04:15,368
I don't care about your past grudges.

80
00:04:15,889 --> 00:04:17,329
Step out of line in Sea Breeze,

81
00:04:17,768 --> 00:04:19,049
and I'll make you pay.

82
00:04:21,009 --> 00:04:22,488
Take him to the infirmary,

83
00:04:22,648 --> 00:04:23,968
and put everyone in solitary.

84
00:04:24,329 --> 00:04:25,329
Yes, ma'am.

85
00:04:25,368 --> 00:04:26,368
You guys,

86
00:04:26,856 --> 00:04:27,830
come out.

87
00:04:29,688 --> 00:04:30,769
4167,

88
00:04:30,849 --> 00:04:32,328
follow me to solitary.

89
00:04:35,849 --> 00:04:37,649
When I first came to Prosperity,

90
00:04:38,649 --> 00:04:40,169
it was just for fun.

91
00:04:40,568 --> 00:04:42,649
Just running things with my buddies,

92
00:04:43,008 --> 00:04:44,409
making some money,

93
00:04:44,928 --> 00:04:46,328
and having a good time.

94
00:04:47,368 --> 00:04:48,969
How did it end up like this?

95
00:04:51,928 --> 00:04:53,368
People change.

96
00:04:58,849 --> 00:05:00,008
But I haven't changed.

97
00:05:01,688 --> 00:05:02,928
And I won't.

98
00:05:06,928 --> 00:05:07,928
Mr. Zhao.

99
00:05:13,128 --> 00:05:14,169
I'm sorry.

100
00:05:15,049 --> 00:05:16,049
Come in,

101
00:05:16,169 --> 00:05:17,169
Yunian.

102
00:05:22,609 --> 00:05:23,609
Lu.

103
00:05:24,409 --> 00:05:25,688
Thanks for today.

104
00:05:29,128 --> 00:05:30,128
Lu,

105
00:05:30,289 --> 00:05:31,289
Manni,

106
00:05:31,568 --> 00:05:32,649
I came today

107
00:05:33,049 --> 00:05:34,969
to tell you something.

108
00:05:36,368 --> 00:05:37,368
I know

109
00:05:37,928 --> 00:05:39,209
you resent me

110
00:05:39,209 --> 00:05:40,808
for Jiasheng getting locked up.

111
00:05:41,448 --> 00:05:42,849
But I want you to know,

112
00:05:43,808 --> 00:05:44,808
him going to prison

113
00:05:45,849 --> 00:05:47,609
wasn't just about my sister.

114
00:05:47,609 --> 00:05:48,888
Jiasheng told me to do it.

115
00:05:49,448 --> 00:05:50,448
Why?

116
00:05:50,568 --> 00:05:52,089
He didn't say anything

117
00:05:52,409 --> 00:05:53,409
but that

118
00:05:53,609 --> 00:05:55,049
he had to get into Sea Breeze Prison.

119
00:05:55,169 --> 00:05:56,969
- He has to find someone.
- Find who?

120
00:05:57,248 --> 00:05:58,248
I don't know.

121
00:05:58,649 --> 00:06:01,289
He said this person can help him
turn the tables.

122
00:06:01,529 --> 00:06:02,529
Quiet!

123
00:06:03,128 --> 00:06:04,128
Pretty boy.

124
00:06:07,448 --> 00:06:08,448
Shut your mouth.

125
00:06:08,448 --> 00:06:10,248
♪Little pig, little pig♪

126
00:06:10,609 --> 00:06:12,049
♪Plump and round♪

127
00:06:12,808 --> 00:06:14,368
♪Lying in bed♪

128
00:06:14,368 --> 00:06:16,248
- Move!
- ♪Snoring loud♪

129
00:06:26,209 --> 00:06:27,969
I didn't bring enough guys today.

130
00:06:28,328 --> 00:06:29,328
Tang,

131
00:06:29,688 --> 00:06:30,849
get my men out

132
00:06:31,649 --> 00:06:33,089
of solitary confinement

133
00:06:33,089 --> 00:06:34,089
later.

134
00:06:34,169 --> 00:06:35,609
We can definitely take him down.

135
00:06:35,969 --> 00:06:38,568
Xia Yuyan locked your men in solitary.

136
00:06:39,248 --> 00:06:40,609
You know who she is.

137
00:06:41,248 --> 00:06:42,248
We were careless.

138
00:06:42,688 --> 00:06:44,089
Didn't expect Tu Jiasheng

139
00:06:44,289 --> 00:06:45,448
could fight like that.

140
00:06:46,928 --> 00:06:48,729
Don't worry, Chief Phachai.

141
00:06:49,649 --> 00:06:51,568
Tu Jiasheng can't escape.

142
00:06:51,649 --> 00:06:52,769
Inside Sea Breeze,

143
00:06:53,128 --> 00:06:55,409
we have plenty of time to play with him.

144
00:06:58,089 --> 00:06:59,609
He thinks he can fight?

145
00:06:59,769 --> 00:07:01,128
Then let him fight.

146
00:07:01,328 --> 00:07:03,008
Once he's out of solitary,

147
00:07:03,448 --> 00:07:05,368
set up a match for him.

148
00:07:10,808 --> 00:07:11,808
Tu Jiasheng,

149
00:07:11,969 --> 00:07:13,729
Sea Breeze isn't Prosperity.

150
00:07:14,248 --> 00:07:16,368
No one here is calling you boss.

151
00:07:16,409 --> 00:07:17,409
In here,

152
00:07:17,488 --> 00:07:19,169
you're just 4167.

153
00:07:19,248 --> 00:07:21,089
I don't care how tough you used to be,

154
00:07:21,289 --> 00:07:23,008
or who you're connected to.

155
00:07:23,008 --> 00:07:24,328
In my block,

156
00:07:24,409 --> 00:07:25,769
rules are rules.

157
00:07:28,049 --> 00:07:29,049
I know the rules.

158
00:07:29,649 --> 00:07:30,649
Around here,

159
00:07:30,649 --> 00:07:32,289
there are plenty of tough guys.

160
00:07:32,808 --> 00:07:34,769
Plenty of them can bring you
to your knees.

161
00:07:35,049 --> 00:07:36,089
Don't end up

162
00:07:36,209 --> 00:07:38,808
not even knowing what killed you.

163
00:07:39,368 --> 00:07:40,368
Thanks for the concern.

164
00:07:42,289 --> 00:07:43,849
I'll stay alive.

165
00:08:19,649 --> 00:08:20,729
What else did he say?

166
00:08:20,888 --> 00:08:22,008
He also said

167
00:08:23,049 --> 00:08:24,169
after he went in,

168
00:08:24,248 --> 00:08:25,849
Prosperity would fall into chaos.

169
00:08:26,529 --> 00:08:28,049
He told me to come to you two
if anything happened.

170
00:08:28,169 --> 00:08:29,849
You're the ones he trusts most.

171
00:08:35,568 --> 00:08:36,568
Yunian,

172
00:08:37,089 --> 00:08:38,089
have a seat.

173
00:08:42,968 --> 00:08:43,968
Today,

174
00:08:44,369 --> 00:08:46,848
though Nie Feng put Bai Ruxue in charge,

175
00:08:47,889 --> 00:08:48,889
don't worry.

176
00:08:50,169 --> 00:08:51,169
We are here.

177
00:08:52,489 --> 00:08:53,608
We'll handle this together,

178
00:08:54,928 --> 00:08:56,249
and wait for Jiasheng to get out.

179
00:08:57,049 --> 00:08:58,088
Thank you, Manni.

180
00:08:59,568 --> 00:09:00,568
Thank you, Lu.

181
00:09:08,529 --> 00:09:09,529
(Enter Sea Breeze Prison)

182
00:09:09,928 --> 00:09:11,129
Find him, get close to him,

183
00:09:11,489 --> 00:09:12,769
and get what we need.

184
00:09:13,129 --> 00:09:14,529
I'll take care
of the Nie family for you.

185
00:09:17,129 --> 00:09:20,968
♪Little pig, little pig,
plump and round♪

186
00:09:21,649 --> 00:09:25,249
♪Lying in bed, snoring loud♪

187
00:09:27,934 --> 00:09:30,916
(Seven days later)

188
00:10:01,169 --> 00:10:02,728
Mr. Zhang, look here.

189
00:10:02,968 --> 00:10:03,968
Take your pick.

190
00:10:04,608 --> 00:10:05,688
(Body Measurements)
Gorgeous!

191
00:10:11,649 --> 00:10:12,649
Yu Yingwan.

192
00:10:13,409 --> 00:10:15,369
- I want her.
- Right away, Mr. Zhang.

193
00:10:15,968 --> 00:10:16,968
Yu Yingwan.

194
00:10:17,928 --> 00:10:19,728
- This way please, Mr. Zhang.
- Let's go.

195
00:10:50,489 --> 00:10:51,489
In the past,

196
00:10:52,169 --> 00:10:54,129
you Tian Class girls

197
00:10:54,848 --> 00:10:56,289
were so full of yourselves.

198
00:10:57,328 --> 00:10:59,169
You wouldn't even give me
a second glance.

199
00:11:00,328 --> 00:11:02,169
I requested you so many times,

200
00:11:02,769 --> 00:11:05,249
and you wouldn't even
have a drink with me.

201
00:11:05,968 --> 00:11:07,009
And now?

202
00:11:08,249 --> 00:11:10,169
Aren't you sitting here obediently,

203
00:11:11,129 --> 00:11:12,129
letting me whip you?

204
00:11:26,728 --> 00:11:27,728
Say something!

205
00:11:29,249 --> 00:11:30,889
Weren't you arrogant before?

206
00:11:34,568 --> 00:11:35,568
Cry out,

207
00:11:36,769 --> 00:11:38,088
and let me hear it!

208
00:11:38,808 --> 00:11:39,889
Scream! Come on!

209
00:11:40,848 --> 00:11:41,848
Scream!

210
00:12:10,747 --> 00:12:14,363
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

211
00:12:14,733 --> 00:12:18,718
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

212
00:12:23,474 --> 00:12:26,793
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

213
00:12:26,793 --> 00:12:31,878
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

214
00:12:35,467 --> 00:12:42,019
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

215
00:12:42,019 --> 00:12:50,440
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

216
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:53,669
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

217
00:12:53,669 --> 00:12:56,864
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

218
00:12:56,864 --> 00:12:59,557
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

219
00:12:59,557 --> 00:13:04,174
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

220
00:13:08,085 --> 00:13:10,574
♪Burning alone♪

221
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:22,449
♪The glory fades♪
